<section id="recruitment" class="recruitment" aria-labelledby="recruitment-heading" aria-busy="true">
  <header class="intro">
    <p class="eyebrow">Tu siguiente paso en UNICODE</p>
    <h1 id="recruitment-heading">Tu talento. <span>Nuestra comunidad.</span></h1>
    <p>Completa tus datos y cuéntanos quién eres en un video de un minuto.</p>
  </header>

  <p id="recruitment-status" class="status" role="status" aria-live="polite">Consultando la convocatoria…</p>
  <p id="development-notice" class="notice" hidden>Modo de prueba local. No completes aquí una postulación real.</p>
  <div id="recruitment-error" class="notice error" role="alert" hidden></div>
  <div id="recruitment-closed" class="panel" hidden>
    <h2 id="closed-heading">La convocatoria aún no está disponible</h2>
    <p id="closed-reason"></p>
    <a class="button secondary" href="/call">Ver convocatoria</a>
  </div>
  <noscript><p class="notice error">Activa JavaScript para guardar tu postulación y grabar el video.</p></noscript>

  <div id="recruitment-flow" hidden>
    <p id="save-status" class="save-indicator" role="status" aria-live="polite" hidden><span aria-hidden="true"></span><span id="save-status-text"></span></p>
    <ol class="steps" aria-label="Pasos de tu postulación">
      <li id="step-data" aria-current="step"><span>1</span> Tus datos</li>
      <li id="step-video"><span>2</span> Tu video</li>
      <li id="step-complete"><span>3</span> Confirmación</li>
    </ol>

    <aside id="resume-panel" class="resume-panel" hidden>
      <div><strong>Tu borrador está guardado</strong><p>Este navegador recordará tu avance aunque lo cierres. Para continuar en otro dispositivo usa tu enlace personal (también te lo enviamos por correo). No lo compartas: permite acceder a tu postulación.</p></div>
      <div class="resume-actions"><button id="copy-resume" type="button" class="button secondary">Copiar enlace personal</button><button id="forget-device" type="button" class="button secondary compact">No es mi dispositivo: olvidar aquí</button></div>
    </aside>

    <section id="data-phase" class="panel" aria-labelledby="data-heading">
      <h2 id="data-heading" tabindex="-1">Primero, vamos a conocerte</h2>
      <p>Los campos con * son obligatorios. Tu avance se guarda automáticamente mientras escribes.</p>
      <form id="recruitment-data-form">
        <fieldset id="data-fields">
          <legend class="sr-only">Datos de la postulación</legend>
          <div class="field-grid">
            <div class="field"><label for="firstName">Nombres *</label><input id="firstName" name="firstName" required maxlength="150" autocomplete="given-name" /></div>
            <div class="field"><label for="lastName">Apellidos *</label><input id="lastName" name="lastName" required maxlength="150" autocomplete="family-name" /></div>
            <div class="field"><label for="email">Correo electrónico *</label><input id="email" name="email" type="email" required maxlength="254" autocomplete="email" /><p class="hint">Revísalo bien: al guardarse tu borrador quedará asociado a tu enlace personal y no se podrá cambiar después.</p></div>
            <div class="field"><label for="phone">Celular *</label><input id="phone" name="phone" type="tel" required pattern="[0-9]{9}" minlength="9" maxlength="9" inputmode="numeric" autocomplete="tel-national" placeholder="999999999" title="Ingresa los 9 dígitos de tu celular, sin espacios." /></div>
            <div class="field"><label for="university">Universidad *</label><input id="university" name="university" required maxlength="150" autocomplete="organization" /></div>
            <div class="field"><label for="faculty">Facultad *</label><input id="faculty" name="faculty" required maxlength="150" /></div>
            <div class="field"><label for="career">Carrera *</label><input id="career" name="career" required maxlength="150" /></div>
            <div class="field"><label for="admissionTerm">Periodo de ingreso *</label><input id="admissionTerm" name="admissionTerm" required maxlength="6" pattern="[0-9]{4}-[12]" placeholder="Ej. 2024-2" title="Escribe el año y semestre de ingreso, por ejemplo 2024-2." /></div>
            <div class="field"><label for="semester">Ciclo actual *</label><select id="semester" name="semester" required><option value="">Selecciona tu ciclo</option>{Array.from({length:10}, (_, i) => <option value={String(i+1)}>{i+1}.º ciclo</option>)}<option value="0">Egresado/a</option></select></div>
            <div class="field"><label for="availabilityHours">Horas disponibles por semana *</label><input id="availabilityHours" name="availabilityHours" type="number" required min="0" max="168" step="0.5" inputmode="decimal" /><p id="availability-hint" class="hint">Considera el tiempo que puedes dedicar a las actividades de UNICODE.</p></div>
            <div class="field"><label for="firstChoiceArea">Primera opción de área *</label><select id="firstChoiceArea" name="firstChoiceArea" required><option value="">Selecciona un área</option></select></div>
            <div class="field"><label for="secondChoiceArea">Segunda opción de área</label><select id="secondChoiceArea" name="secondChoiceArea"><option value="">Sin segunda opción</option></select></div>
          </div>
          <div class="field"><label for="motivation">¿Por qué quieres unirte a UNICODE? *</label><textarea id="motivation" name="motivation" rows="4" required maxlength="2000"></textarea><p class="hint">Hasta 2000 caracteres.</p></div>
          <div class="consent"><input id="consent" name="consent" type="checkbox" required /><label for="consent">Autorizo el uso de mis datos y mi video para evaluar esta postulación y contactarme durante el proceso. El acceso estará limitado al equipo autorizado de selección. Lee la <a href="/privacidad" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="privacy-link">política de privacidad</a>. *</label></div>
        </fieldset>
        <div class="actions"><button id="continue-video" type="submit" class="button primary">Continuar al video →</button></div>
      </form>
    </section>

    <section id="video-phase" class="panel" aria-labelledby="video-heading" hidden>
      <div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">Paso 2</p><h2 id="video-heading" tabindex="-1">Cuatro preguntas. Un solo video.</h2></div><button id="edit-data" type="button" class="button secondary compact">Revisar mis datos</button></div>
      <p id="video-instructions">Responde las cuatro preguntas en un video de hasta 60 segundos en total. Las preguntas se mantienen al volver a entrar.</p>
      <div id="active-capture-banner" class="active-capture-banner" hidden><span>Grabando tu respuesta</span><strong id="capture-banner-timer">00:00 / 01:00</strong><button id="finish-capture" type="button" class="button danger compact">Terminar</button></div>
      <div id="assigned-questions" class="questions"></div>
      <div class="video-grid">
        <div class="camera-box">
          <video id="camera-preview" autoplay muted playsinline aria-label="Vista previa de tu cámara"></video>
          <p id="camera-placeholder">Prueba tu cámara y micrófono antes de grabar.</p>
          <div id="recording-indicator" class="recording-indicator" hidden><span></span><span id="recording-label">Grabando</span><strong id="recording-timer">00:00</strong></div>
        </div>
        <div class="video-controls">
          <h3>Prepárate con calma</h3>
          <p id="preparation-instructions">Tendrás 30 segundos de preparación al iniciar. El contador de tu respuesta comenzará después.</p>
          <p>El ensayo de 10 segundos solo sirve para revisar tu audio y tu imagen. Se elimina al terminar y no se envía.</p>
          <div class="actions stacked"><button id="test-camera" type="button" class="button secondary">Activar cámara y micrófono</button><button id="rehearse" type="button" class="button secondary" disabled>Hacer ensayo de 10 segundos</button><button id="start-recording" type="button" class="button primary" disabled>Iniciar preparación y grabar</button><button id="stop-recording" type="button" class="button danger" hidden>Terminar grabación</button></div>
          <p id="camera-status" class="hint" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
          <div id="rehearsal-result" hidden><h4>Revisa tu ensayo</h4><video id="rehearsal-preview" controls playsinline aria-label="Video de ensayo"></video><button id="discard-rehearsal" class="button secondary compact" type="button">Eliminar ensayo</button></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div id="technical-help" class="technical-help"><h3>¿Tuviste un problema técnico?</h3><p>Si la grabación falla, puedes registrar el problema y usar una única alternativa. Las preguntas serán las mismas.</p><label for="failure-reason">Qué ocurrió</label><select id="failure-reason"><option value="">Selecciona el problema</option><option value="permission">No pude habilitar la cámara o el micrófono</option><option value="unsupported">Mi navegador no permite grabar</option><option value="interrupted">La grabación se interrumpió o se perdió</option><option value="device">El audio o la cámara fallaron durante la grabación</option></select><button id="report-failure" type="button" class="button secondary">Registrar falla técnica</button></div>

      <div id="alternate-upload" class="notice" hidden><h3>Tu alternativa está habilitada</h3><p>Graba un video respondiendo las mismas cuatro preguntas y súbelo aquí. Esta alternativa se puede usar una sola vez.</p><label for="alternate-file">Seleccionar video</label><input id="alternate-file" type="file" accept="video/mp4,video/webm" /><p id="alternate-limit" class="hint"></p></div>

      <div id="video-result" class="video-result" hidden><h3>Revisa tu video</h3><video id="answer-preview" controls playsinline aria-label="Video de tu postulación"></video><p id="answer-details" class="hint"></p><p id="unuploaded-warning" class="hint">Conserva esta pestaña abierta hasta que termine la subida. Si la conexión falla, tu video seguirá aquí para volver a intentar.</p><button id="upload-video" type="button" class="button primary">Guardar este video</button></div>
      <div id="upload-progress-panel" hidden><label for="upload-progress">Guardando tu video</label><progress id="upload-progress" value="0" max="100"></progress><p id="upload-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p></div>
      <div id="video-saved" class="notice success" hidden><h3>Tu video está guardado</h3><p>Solo falta confirmar el envío de tu postulación.</p></div>
      <div class="actions final-action"><button id="submit-application" class="button primary" type="button" disabled>Confirmar y enviar postulación</button></div>
    </section>

    <section id="complete-phase" class="panel complete" aria-labelledby="complete-heading" hidden><span class="complete-icon" aria-hidden="true">✓</span><p class="eyebrow">Postulación recibida</p><h2 id="complete-heading" tabindex="-1">Gracias por dar el primer paso.</h2><p>Tus datos, preguntas asignadas y video quedaron registrados. Te informaremos sobre el proceso por el correo que proporcionaste.</p><p id="application-reference" class="hint"></p><a class="button secondary" href="/">Volver al inicio</a></section>
  </div>
</section>

<script>
  import "../../scripts/recruitment-form";
</script>

<style>
  .recruitment { --green: #75d32d; --muted: #a1a1aa; }
  .recruitment [hidden] { display: none !important; }
  .intro { margin-bottom: 2rem; }
  .eyebrow { color: var(--green); font-size: .75rem; font-weight: 650; letter-spacing: .12em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  h1 { font-size: clamp(2rem,5vw,3.4rem); line-height: 1.12; font-weight: 750; letter-spacing: -.04em; max-width: 760px; margin: .6rem 0 1rem; }
  h1 span { color: var(--green); }
  h2 { font-size: clamp(1.3rem,3vw,1.75rem); line-height: 1.25; font-weight: 650; margin-bottom: .7rem; }
  h3 { font-weight: 650; font-size: 1rem; margin-bottom: .5rem; }
  h4 { font-size: .9rem; font-weight: 650; margin: .8rem 0; }
  p { color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.65; font-size: .9rem; }
  .panel { background: #0e0e10; border: 1px solid #27272a; border-radius: 1.5rem; padding: clamp(1.2rem,4vw,2.4rem); }
  .status { margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .steps { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: .6rem 1.2rem; padding: .8rem 0 1.6rem; font-size: .85rem; color: #71717a; }
  .steps li { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: .55rem; }
  .steps span { display: grid; place-items: center; border: 1px solid #3f3f46; border-radius: 50%; width: 1.8rem; height: 1.8rem; }
  .steps [aria-current] { color: white; }
  .steps [aria-current] span { color: #0a0a0a; background: var(--green); border-color: var(--green); }
  .resume-panel { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 1rem; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; padding: 1rem 1.2rem; border: 1px solid #75d32d40; border-radius: 1rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; background: #75d32d08; }
  .resume-panel > div:first-child { flex: 1 1 300px; }
  .resume-actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: .6rem; }
  .resume-panel strong { font-size: .9rem; }
  .resume-panel p { margin-top: .3rem; font-size: .8rem; }
  form { margin-top: 1.5rem; }
  fieldset { min-width: 0; }
  .field-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr)); gap: 0 1.2rem; }
  .field { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: .45rem; margin-bottom: 1.2rem; }
  label { font-size: .85rem; font-weight: 550; color: #d4d4d8; }
  input:not([type=checkbox]),select,textarea { color: white; background: #171719; width: 100%; border: 1px solid #3f3f46; border-radius: .7rem; padding: .8rem .9rem; font-size: .9rem; }
  input:focus,select:focus,textarea:focus { outline: 2px solid var(--green); outline-offset: 2px; }
  input::placeholder { color: #71717a; }
  input[type=file] { margin-top: .5rem; }
  select { min-height: 3rem; }
  textarea { resize: vertical; }
  .hint { font-size: .75rem; }
  .consent { display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: .7rem; margin: .5rem 0 1.6rem; }
  .consent input { width: 1.15rem; height: 1.15rem; accent-color: var(--green); margin-top: .2rem; flex-shrink: 0; }
  .consent label { font-weight: 400; font-size: .8rem; line-height: 1.6; }
  .privacy-link { color: var(--green); text-decoration: underline; }
  .actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: .7rem; margin-top: 1rem; }
  .button { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; text-align: center; border-radius: .75rem; min-height: 3rem; padding: .8rem 1.1rem; font-size: .85rem; font-weight: 650; cursor: pointer; transition: background .2s, border-color .2s; border: 1px solid transparent; }
  .button:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid white; outline-offset: 3px; }
  .button:disabled { opacity: .4; cursor: not-allowed; }
  .primary { color: #0a0a0a; background: var(--green); }
  .primary:hover:enabled { background: #94e65a; }
  .secondary { border-color: #3f3f46; color: #e4e4e7; background: #171719; }
  .secondary:hover:enabled { border-color: #71717a; background: #27272a; }
  .danger { background: #7f1d1d; color: white; }
  .compact { font-size: .75rem; min-height: 2.5rem; padding: .6rem .8rem; }
  .notice { border: 1px solid #3f3f46; background: #171719; border-radius: 1rem; padding: 1.1rem; margin: 1rem 0; }
  .error { border-color: #f8717180; color: #fecaca; background: #7f1d1d20; }
  .success { border-color: #75d32d60; background: #75d32d0d; }
  #development-notice { border-color: #facc1580; background: #facc150f; color: #fde68a; font-weight: 600; }
  .section-heading { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; gap: 1rem; }
  .questions { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr)); gap: .8rem; margin: 1.2rem 0; }
  .active-capture-banner { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: .8rem; position: sticky; top: 6rem; z-index: 20; background: #18181bf5; border: 1px solid #75d32d80; border-radius: .8rem; padding: .7rem 1rem; margin-top: 1rem; font-size: .8rem; }
  .active-capture-banner strong { font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; margin-left: auto; }
  .questions :global(.question-group) { border: 1px solid #3f3f46; border-radius: 1rem; padding: 1rem; }
  .questions :global(h3) { color: var(--green); font-size: .75rem; font-weight: 650; line-height: 1.5; }
  .questions :global(ol) { list-style: decimal; margin: .7rem 0 0 1.2rem; }
  .questions :global(li) { font-size: .85rem; line-height: 1.65; color: #e4e4e7; margin: .7rem 0; padding-left: .2rem; }
  .video-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 1fr; gap: 1.5rem; margin: 1.5rem 0; align-items: start; }
  .camera-box { position: relative; aspect-ratio: 4/3; background: #171719; border: 1px solid #3f3f46; border-radius: 1rem; overflow: hidden; }
  .camera-box video { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; }
  .camera-box > p { position: absolute; inset: 0; display: grid; place-items: center; padding: 2rem; text-align: center; }
  .recording-indicator { display: flex; gap: .5rem; align-items: center; background: #09090be6; position: absolute; bottom: .8rem; left: .8rem; right: .8rem; padding: .65rem .8rem; font-size: .75rem; border-radius: .6rem; }
  .recording-indicator > span:first-child { width: .6rem; height: .6rem; border-radius: 50%; background: #f87171; }
  .recording-indicator strong { margin-left: auto; color: white; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; font-size: 1rem; }
  .stacked { flex-direction: column; }
  .technical-help { border-top: 1px solid #27272a; padding-top: 1.5rem; margin-top: 1.5rem; }
  .technical-help label { display: block; margin: 1rem 0 .5rem; }
  .technical-help .button { margin-top: .7rem; }
  .video-result { border-top: 1px solid #27272a; padding-top: 1.5rem; margin-top: 1.5rem; }
  #answer-preview,#rehearsal-preview { width: 100%; max-height: 440px; border-radius: .7rem; background: #09090b; margin: .5rem 0; }
  progress { width: 100%; height: 1rem; accent-color: var(--green); margin: .7rem 0; }
  #upload-progress-panel { margin-top: 1.2rem; }
  .final-action { border-top: 1px solid #27272a; padding-top: 1.2rem; }
  .save-indicator { position: fixed; z-index: 40; left: 50%; bottom: 1rem; transform: translateX(-50%); display: flex; align-items: center; gap: .55rem; width: max-content; max-width: calc(100vw - 2rem); padding: .55rem .95rem; border: 1px solid #3f3f46; border-radius: 999px; background: #18181bf2; color: #e4e4e7; font-size: .78rem; line-height: 1.35; box-shadow: 0 8px 24px #0008; backdrop-filter: blur(6px); }
  .save-indicator > span:first-child { flex-shrink: 0; width: .55rem; height: .55rem; border-radius: 50%; background: #a1a1aa; }
  .save-indicator[data-state=saving] > span:first-child { background: #facc15; animation: pulse 1s ease-in-out infinite; }
  .save-indicator[data-state=saved] > span:first-child { background: var(--green); }
  .save-indicator[data-state=offline] > span:first-child { background: #fb923c; }
  .save-indicator[data-state=error] { border-color: #f8717180; color: #fecaca; }
  .save-indicator[data-state=error] > span:first-child { background: #f87171; }
  @keyframes pulse { 50% { opacity: .35; } }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .save-indicator > span:first-child { animation: none !important; } }
  .complete { text-align: center; }
  #application-reference { overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
  .complete-icon { display: grid; place-items: center; width: 4rem; height: 4rem; margin: 0 auto 1.5rem; border: 1px solid #75d32d60; background: #75d32d15; border-radius: 50%; color: var(--green); font-size: 2rem; }
  .complete .button { margin-top: 1.5rem; }
  @media(max-width:640px) { .field-grid,.questions,.video-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .steps { gap: .7rem; font-size: .7rem; } .steps span { width: 1.5rem; height: 1.5rem; } .steps li { gap: .35rem; } .section-heading { flex-direction: column; } .actions .button { flex: 1 1 100%; } .resume-actions, .resume-panel .button { width: 100%; } .active-capture-banner { top: 5rem; } .active-capture-banner strong { margin-left: 0; } .active-capture-banner .button { flex: 1 1 100%; } }
  /* iOS zooms into fields whose text is smaller than 16px. */
  @media(max-width:768px) { input:not([type=checkbox]),select,textarea { font-size: 1rem; } }
</style>
